# Eternal Witness: "return target card from your graveyard to your hand." Only a card in its controller's own graveyard is a
# candidate: Bot2's Dark Ritual is refused as the trigger goes on the stack, beside Bot1's own Lightning Bolt (and Burst
# Lightning, so there is a choice to ask), which is chosen. Bot2 answers with Ghost Vacuum, exiling that Bolt; its target gone, the trigger is countered on resolution
# (CR 608.2b) - the "you may" is never asked and nothing returns.

